WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:17.670
You've come alone, I see.

00:18.330 --> 00:21.830
Your insolence knows no bounds, Magia Baiser.

00:23.210 --> 00:25.380
I promised my friends...

00:26.130 --> 00:27.830
...that I'd take you down.

00:40.380 --> 00:41.250
Cho cute

00:42.710 --> 00:43.420
Touching

00:45.710 --> 00:46.540
Cho cool

00:47.750 --> 00:48.500
Charming

00:56.750 --> 01:02.000
Taiyo mitai ni sunny pikari kagayaiteru

01:02.000 --> 01:07.380
Nikori egao ga smiley suteki tsuyoi kimochi

01:07.540 --> 01:12.790
Dakedo namida mo teary horori koboreru no ga

01:12.920 --> 01:17.710
Kawaii dake janai miryoku

01:18.080 --> 01:23.290
Ima wa tada sora o miageru watashi no

01:23.460 --> 01:31.500
Kokoro ni mebaeta atarashii chikara o shinjiru no

01:31.630 --> 01:34.080
Akogareru dake janakute

01:34.330 --> 01:36.710
Yume ni miru dake janakute

01:36.880 --> 01:39.500
Naritai kawaritai

01:39.670 --> 01:42.170
Suki ga watashi no minamoto

01:42.420 --> 01:48.630
Hitomi no oku ga ubawareteshimatta hi kara

01:48.630 --> 01:55.170
Zutto iroasenai My Dream Girls

01:55.460 --> 01:56.420
Cho cute

01:57.750 --> 01:58.540
Touching

02:00.830 --> 02:01.670
Cho cool

02:02.830 --> 02:03.670
Charming

02:07.880 --> 02:11.960
<b>Gushing Over World Domination!</b>

02:10.500 --> 02:16.250
What is this, Leoparde?!

02:18.420 --> 02:20.830
You really think I'd tell you?

02:22.380 --> 02:23.460
Get fucked!

02:25.040 --> 02:27.210
Just-fucking-die Bomb!

02:30.000 --> 02:30.920
Take it!

02:31.710 --> 02:32.630
Take it!

02:34.540 --> 02:37.080
Take it, take it, take it!

02:40.210 --> 02:43.380
Her attacks are so much stronger now!

02:44.130 --> 02:48.540
If you were this powerful... why hide it until now?

02:49.750 --> 02:52.670
Fucking die, bitch!

03:05.420 --> 03:08.960
Whaddya think of my TRUE power, huh?!

03:08.960 --> 03:13.920
What, too scared to fight me?! I'm just gettin' started!

03:19.460 --> 03:21.000
What the fuck?!

03:21.630 --> 03:22.920
I see...

03:25.920 --> 03:29.330
Leoparde, you poor thing...

03:29.580 --> 03:33.250
You have no idea how to handle such immense power.

03:34.080 --> 03:41.250
Now it makes sense why you hid your stars
and pretended to have zero.

03:41.670 --> 03:43.630
Because this would happen.

03:44.830 --> 03:50.580
What? That's not why. I was just messing with you!

03:50.790 --> 03:55.330
I'm so sad... You're so brave.

03:56.080 --> 03:59.380
But that won't stop you from dying.

04:00.460 --> 04:02.630
I'm not gonna die!

04:02.920 --> 04:04.080
I'm gonna...

04:04.960 --> 04:06.380
I'm gonna...

04:08.330 --> 04:11.670
I'm gonna go to a hotel!

04:13.130 --> 04:17.380
I'm going with Baiser-chan... I'll be with Baiser-chan...

04:17.710 --> 04:20.830
...on a date at a hotel!

04:25.000 --> 04:29.500
Just thinkin' about it powers me up, big time! I'm so back!

04:29.750 --> 04:32.500
I gotta finish this before it turns out I was just dreamin'!

04:32.500 --> 04:34.880
Die! Die right now!

04:34.880 --> 04:38.630
DO US BOTH A FAVOR AND FUCKING DIE!

04:49.710 --> 04:52.580
Very impressive. However...

04:57.000 --> 04:59.420
I do hope you'll be able to survive this.

05:02.630 --> 05:03.580
It's huge...

05:21.540 --> 05:23.960
What's wrong, Magia Baiser?

05:25.540 --> 05:29.460
Surely this isn't the end.

05:32.750 --> 05:35.880
Die, die, die die, die, die!

05:41.080 --> 05:45.540
How sad... You can't even aim anymore.

05:56.500 --> 05:58.380
I'm so sad...

05:58.920 --> 06:02.000
You don't have what it takes to defeat me.

06:05.420 --> 06:11.500
Please, just give up.
You're only wasting your time, Leoparde.

06:16.080 --> 06:18.000
I'm so sad...

06:20.830 --> 06:24.460
But this is the end!

06:30.670 --> 06:31.630
Wha...?

06:32.130 --> 06:34.580
Hell yeah! Called it!

06:35.040 --> 06:38.130
What? How?!

06:38.790 --> 06:44.330
Didja really think the ground could handle
the two of us duking it out up here?

06:44.790 --> 06:48.830
See? I'm using my head today!

06:52.000 --> 06:55.540
Now, what do I do with you?

06:55.540 --> 07:01.080
I-I understand. I submit.

07:01.710 --> 07:03.880
I've lost.

07:05.210 --> 07:06.040
Look...

07:07.960 --> 07:10.960
You gotta stop with the fake crying.

07:11.580 --> 07:17.960
Wh-what? I wasn't faking...

07:19.580 --> 07:23.960
Show me some real tears.
Then I'll think about letting you live.

07:26.420 --> 07:27.710
Five...

07:28.380 --> 07:29.710
Four...

07:29.710 --> 07:33.630
I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry, I'm so sorry!

07:34.040 --> 07:35.040
Three...

07:36.250 --> 07:40.670
Please forgive me! I'll do whatever you say!

07:40.920 --> 07:41.960
Two...

07:41.960 --> 07:44.460
I shouldn't have hurt you!

07:46.330 --> 07:47.380
One.

07:50.630 --> 07:52.420
Please, don't!

07:53.460 --> 07:54.880
Time's up.

08:02.000 --> 08:06.290
You idiot. I ran outta bullets a while ago.

08:14.580 --> 08:16.920
I did it, Utena-chan.

08:18.080 --> 08:20.420
Next stop, a hotel...

08:21.710 --> 08:24.790
I'm so horny...

08:30.500 --> 08:32.380
I should've known.

08:35.130 --> 08:39.420
Slumber there a while, Magia Baiser.

08:43.380 --> 08:47.540
Nice going, Alice! We can fit all those creeps in there!

08:48.080 --> 08:50.330
Just hold onto them for a little while longer!

08:53.500 --> 08:55.380
Alice! What's wrong?!

08:55.920 --> 08:57.880
Dammit, naptime already?!

08:57.880 --> 09:00.130
Ugh, not now!

09:02.960 --> 09:04.790
Our transformations are falling off!

09:04.790 --> 09:06.630
Oh, come on!

09:18.080 --> 09:19.460
We're so screwed...

09:20.080 --> 09:21.460
Is this it?

09:34.790 --> 09:36.080
It's okay!

09:37.210 --> 09:38.500
We're here to help!

09:39.580 --> 09:41.210
The Tres Magia?

09:41.420 --> 09:44.130
You're the last of the civilians.

09:44.670 --> 09:45.790
Go, hurry!

09:47.880 --> 09:50.790
Looks like they didn't see us
before our transformations fell off...

09:51.080 --> 09:53.380
T-talk about lucky...

09:53.630 --> 09:56.170
What are these gross wriggly things?

09:56.630 --> 09:58.210
Let's take 'em all out!

09:58.380 --> 10:00.040
Wait, don't.

10:01.290 --> 10:03.670
Let me handle them.

10:04.830 --> 10:05.920
Azure...

10:08.170 --> 10:11.000
Do they really think they can take 'em?

10:11.210 --> 10:13.880
Vena said it's impossible...

10:26.000 --> 10:27.420
La Veritas.

10:46.130 --> 10:49.040
Whoa... Holy shit.

10:49.040 --> 10:51.040
N-no freaking way...

10:51.460 --> 10:54.750
She destroyed every last one.

11:04.630 --> 11:10.540
Still, you struggle? You should have known
this would happen if you tried to face me.

11:11.540 --> 11:17.000
Why do you oppose my grand ambition?
Would you prefer we destroyed the world instead?

11:17.790 --> 11:22.790
Or have you suddenly developed an affinity for justice?

11:23.170 --> 11:28.920
Did you want to protect the brainless,
unwashed masses from my iron rule?

11:29.830 --> 11:35.500
You fool. You're no better than those idiot magical girls.

11:35.960 --> 11:38.040
You are powerless and weak!

11:40.040 --> 11:46.380
And I am powerful and strong.
Do you know what that means for you?

11:46.790 --> 11:52.170
The strong will take from the weak.
This is the truth of our world.

11:52.580 --> 11:57.420
And our world exists for me to rule!

12:01.580 --> 12:03.460
Not conscious enough to listen, are you?

12:04.380 --> 12:05.790
I can't do it.

12:06.250 --> 12:08.880
What the heck is she going on about?

12:09.540 --> 12:14.670
It's so boring. Boring, boring, boring, boring!

12:10.250 --> 12:13.790
<b>Sigh</b>

12:14.790 --> 12:18.250
Not a single thing she said could get me interested!

12:20.960 --> 12:22.580
Why is she posing?

12:23.540 --> 12:26.040
C'mon, I've gotta do something...

12:26.250 --> 12:31.380
But I'm not gonna be able to beat her like this...

12:31.960 --> 12:38.630
Think. How do I fight her?
How would I be able to take her down?

12:39.920 --> 12:45.080
Why's she so obsessed with world domination,
anyways? She's not a little kid anymore...

12:47.880 --> 12:49.380
A little kid...

12:53.210 --> 12:55.750
What is this power?

12:56.500 --> 12:57.710
Is this Magia Baiser's doing?

12:58.630 --> 13:03.960
Oh, Lord. You asked if I'd developed a love for justice.

13:04.670 --> 13:09.210
Do you know who protects the weak
and fights for peace?

13:10.580 --> 13:14.880
Magical girls, that's who. That's their job.

13:16.380 --> 13:19.420
You wretch... What are you trying to say?

13:20.130 --> 13:24.210
They're the reason I'm Magia Baiser!

13:27.670 --> 13:30.130
Wha...? What is happening?!

13:32.080 --> 13:35.210
Damn you! What have you done?!

13:36.710 --> 13:38.630
Answer me, Magia Baiser!

13:41.880 --> 13:44.380
H-how?

13:45.210 --> 13:48.540
How did she destroy my monsters?!

13:55.710 --> 14:02.000
The strong will take from the weak.
That's what you said, right, Lord Enorme?

14:02.830 --> 14:07.290
Then you shall have everything taken from you!

14:12.330 --> 14:15.130
Magia Baiser... Who...?

14:15.830 --> 14:17.580
What are you?!

14:18.420 --> 14:20.710
Come, let's get started.

14:21.460 --> 14:23.580
It's time for your punishment.

14:23.880 --> 14:27.670
Punishment? Don't be ridiculous!

14:31.130 --> 14:34.080
Prostrate yourself before my overwhelming power,

14:34.080 --> 14:35.460
Magia Baiser!

14:38.380 --> 14:41.290
Somewhere, someday,

14:42.330 --> 14:45.920
someone out there may defeat me.

14:48.080 --> 14:51.330
But not here, not today.

14:53.460 --> 14:55.250
And not you.

14:59.880 --> 15:02.330
What the hell is this?!

15:02.830 --> 15:05.000
Baiser, we're here to help!

15:07.580 --> 15:09.000
What the hell?

15:09.500 --> 15:14.330
Oh, you're all okay! Wait there for just a moment.

15:14.500 --> 15:15.170
Huh?

15:15.630 --> 15:16.540
Okay.

15:21.170 --> 15:25.040
Remember what I said?
Everything will be taken from you.

15:25.790 --> 15:28.250
Wait, what the actual hell is going on here?!

15:28.460 --> 15:29.170
Dude.

15:30.580 --> 15:33.380
Look at that.

15:34.710 --> 15:36.130
Who the hell is that?

15:36.790 --> 15:39.040
Perfect timing, you two.

15:40.040 --> 15:45.580
That's Lord Enorme.
She's seeing her through her own filter.

15:45.920 --> 15:46.710
Huh...?

15:47.750 --> 15:51.580
She couldn't jive with Lord's personality before.
That's why she was losing.

15:51.580 --> 15:57.920
So she twisted Lord's image
into something she'd be more into fighting.

15:58.750 --> 16:01.540
Someone she could look down on.

16:01.830 --> 16:02.960
What?

16:02.960 --> 16:03.880
Yikes.

16:04.290 --> 16:10.130
Damn, my Baiser-chan is cool!
That's the woman who stole my heart!

16:10.330 --> 16:12.540
You're seriously okay with THAT?

16:14.380 --> 16:15.960
I can't move...!

16:16.250 --> 16:21.670
Your power's so boring. All it can do is crush and smash.

16:24.500 --> 16:28.250
Though I suppose it will make for fine shackles.

16:28.830 --> 16:29.710
Wha...?

16:31.960 --> 16:35.170
What?! How dare you!

16:39.630 --> 16:40.540
Don't!

16:44.130 --> 16:45.580
Yes. This is perfect.

16:45.580 --> 16:49.170
Y-you fiend... What are you going to do to me?!

16:59.250 --> 17:02.500
What the hell?! What kind of battle is this?!

17:05.080 --> 17:10.580
Oh, Lord. This isn't a battle, this is your punishment.

17:10.960 --> 17:16.540
And by that mouth on you,
it sounds like you aren't sorry for what you've done!

17:17.460 --> 17:20.380
Loco! Leber! Help me!

17:20.380 --> 17:24.330
Help me, and I'll forgive you your crimes! Just hurry!

17:24.330 --> 17:26.630
Uh... no.

17:27.500 --> 17:31.130
I don't think we can...
And I don't wanna end up where you are.

17:31.130 --> 17:32.500
You traitors...

17:32.500 --> 17:33.250
Take this!

17:35.210 --> 17:39.750
Why?! I was meant to rule the world!

17:39.750 --> 17:41.330
Why is this...

17:42.880 --> 17:43.710
...happening...

17:44.880 --> 17:45.830
...to me?!

17:46.080 --> 17:48.790
Don't ask us.

17:49.130 --> 17:49.960
Yeah.

17:50.420 --> 17:55.040
Why? You pissed off Baiser-chan, that's why.

17:56.210 --> 18:00.830
Lord Enorme. Are you sorry?

18:01.040 --> 18:04.880
D-don't be ridiculous! I'll never apologize to you!

18:10.670 --> 18:16.630
No... Don't rub it...

18:18.040 --> 18:25.750
Careful now, Lord Enorme.
You've nothing left to you now.

18:34.040 --> 18:37.540
I'm... sorry!

18:41.750 --> 18:44.670
There. Good girl.

18:45.330 --> 18:46.290
Wait...

18:47.000 --> 18:48.290
Does this mean...?

18:48.540 --> 18:51.210
That's right, everyone.

18:52.960 --> 18:56.000
Victory is ours!

18:56.460 --> 18:58.170
Hell yeah!

18:58.460 --> 19:00.960
Utena-chan!

19:00.960 --> 19:02.330
Kiwi-chan!

19:13.130 --> 19:17.500
How dare she treat me like that...

19:19.000 --> 19:22.250
How? How did this happen?!

19:23.000 --> 19:26.710
Remember what I said? Pride comes before the fall.

19:26.920 --> 19:29.880
Venalita! You traitor!

19:30.380 --> 19:36.630
You would've had everything you wanted,
if only you'd done what I said.

19:37.170 --> 19:42.460
At least you had fun, though, right?
Borrowed or not, that power's a blast.

19:44.290 --> 19:46.130
What do you mean, borrowed?

19:46.500 --> 19:50.580
Their power comes from within them.

19:51.420 --> 19:56.920
Your power came from the boatload
I gave you to play with.

19:57.210 --> 19:58.130
Wha...?

19:58.750 --> 20:01.630
You still helped me get what I want, though.

20:01.630 --> 20:06.170
They're a whole lot stronger now, thanks to you.

20:06.580 --> 20:10.960
Not too bad for a throwaway pawn, Lord Enorme.

20:12.330 --> 20:14.420
YOU BASTARD!

20:20.290 --> 20:23.080
Good work, Sister.

20:23.290 --> 20:28.000
What exhausting work it was... I'm so tired.

20:28.500 --> 20:35.170
Vena-san, why didn't you tell me
about Leoparde's true power level?

20:35.380 --> 20:38.880
'Cause I wanted to surprise you.
Pretty good surprise, huh?

20:39.250 --> 20:43.330
I would've been better off without your little prank...

20:43.580 --> 20:48.580
But I suppose it's all part of your plan, isn't it, Vena-san?

20:49.170 --> 20:53.210
Yep. I've got everything in the palm of my little hand.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.000
Vena-san!

20:55.290 --> 20:57.750
Hey, Utena. What's up?

20:57.750 --> 21:01.460
I'm looking for Lord. She disappeared on me...

21:01.630 --> 21:06.460
Don't worry. I just finished her off.

21:06.460 --> 21:09.250
Oh... I guess that's that.

21:10.210 --> 21:12.170
She was pretty weak after all that.

21:13.130 --> 21:15.750
What's wrong, Utena?

21:16.750 --> 21:17.670
Nothing.

21:20.460 --> 21:27.750
Anyways, you five did a hell of a job today.
I'd say that deserves a hell of a reward.

21:27.920 --> 21:31.170
Ooh! Build a hotel at Nacht Base!

21:31.170 --> 21:31.880
Don't die!

21:31.880 --> 21:33.290
Sure, you got it.

21:34.040 --> 21:36.380
Yes! Hell yes!

21:36.880 --> 21:39.170
Why're you looking at us?!

21:39.630 --> 21:45.710
Utena and Kiwi, you guys put in a whole lotta effort.
I gotta show you I appreciate that.

21:45.880 --> 21:49.920
We're getting a hotel! Whaddya wanna do, huh?!

21:51.210 --> 21:53.540
K..Kiwi-chan, I said don't die!

21:53.670 --> 21:56.290
And for you, Utena...

21:56.460 --> 22:00.920
Here's an idea: you get to be
the new Supreme Commander of Enormita.

22:04.540 --> 22:05.250
What?

22:07.540 --> 22:13.210
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

22:13.380 --> 22:16.210
Chotto warui ko nano sorry

22:17.080 --> 22:19.330
Ijiwaru shitai

22:19.630 --> 22:25.250
Toutosa matte yosasugite honto shindoi kami oshi na anata ni

22:25.420 --> 22:32.380
Sasageru ai no katachi tobikiri no togetoge sadistic

22:32.540 --> 22:35.330
Madamada yumemigachi na shojo

22:35.580 --> 22:38.460
Akogareteita no wa shujinkou

22:38.630 --> 22:44.210
Nande watashi wa sou narenai no? Nante ochikonda keredo

22:44.210 --> 22:50.080
Doki tte kizuichatta kanjou mahou ni kakatte daibousou

22:50.210 --> 22:53.170
Benkyou mo nichijou mo te ni tsukanakute

22:53.170 --> 22:56.330
Mousou shichau risou no situation

22:56.500 --> 23:01.710
Bakudan mitai ni asobu no datte

23:02.080 --> 23:07.580
Waruku wa nai no ka mo ne

23:07.580 --> 23:13.250
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

23:13.420 --> 23:19.130
Chanto jibun nari no story aruite yukou for me

23:19.500 --> 23:21.670
Ano ko no motto kagayaite

23:21.670 --> 23:25.210
Motto shigekiteki na sugata mitai kara

23:25.420 --> 23:32.460
Uketotte ai no katachi tobikiri no kodawari na fetish

23:35.500 --> 23:40.330
<b>Supreme Commander Magia Basier Calls the Shots</b>
